{"3698150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombitality", "steam_appid": 3698150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive. Adapt. Overcome.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698150/extras/68be6c1b69e64b8be804dc5f1069ae69.poster.avif?t=1768462066\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698150/extras/68be6c1b69e64b8be804dc5f1069ae69.webm?t=1768462066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698150/extras/68be6c1b69e64b8be804dc5f1069ae69.mp4?t=1768462066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Zombitality</strong>: a <strong>heartbeat-quick action shooter</strong> that combines <strong>satisfying auto-combat</strong> with <strong>intense, decision-driven skill use</strong>. You command a <strong>small squad of survivors</strong> — each with <strong>distinct weapons</strong> and <strong>signature abilities</strong> — and your goal is simple: <strong>get to the evac point alive</strong>. It’s <strong>easy to pick up, brutal to master</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What makes Zombitality addictive</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic squad combat</strong>: Run missions with a <strong>3-man team</strong> — <strong>snipers, assault troopers, medics</strong> and more — each playing a clear tactical role. <strong>Swap loadouts, chain abilities and craft synergies</strong> that shred hordes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Strategy with Player-Driven Action</strong>: <strong>Basic firing happens automatically</strong> so the action never stalls. You decide when to <strong>drop the big skills</strong> — a perfectly timed <strong>heal</strong>, an <strong>explosive barrage</strong>, or a <strong>lockdown ability</strong> can flip a fight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698150/extras/93932ab3932e3cbb9b75fea69ecc4167.poster.avif?t=1768462066\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698150/extras/93932ab3932e3cbb9b75fea69ecc4167.webm?t=1768462066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698150/extras/93932ab3932e3cbb9b75fea69ecc4167.mp4?t=1768462066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On-the-fly progression</strong>: Defeat enemies to <strong>earn temporary combat buffs mid-run</strong> — <strong>stack them, adapt your build</strong>, and push deeper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent growth</strong>: Between runs, spend <strong>upgrades</strong> on <strong>weapons, skill trees and permanent perks</strong> to tailor each survivor to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-tension levels</strong>: Long, <strong>claustrophobic corridor maps</strong> ramp up tension with <strong>environmental triggers, surprise waves, towering bosses</strong> and one objective: <strong>survive to evac</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698150/extras/e793685d0f3681e353a2afac3be96e38.poster.avif?t=1768462066\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698150/extras/e793685d0f3681e353a2afac3be96e38.webm?t=1768462066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698150/extras/e793685d0f3681e353a2afac3be96e38.mp4?t=1768462066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why you’ll keep coming back</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run is different</strong>: <strong>randomized power-ups, divergent skill choices</strong> and <strong>multiple class combos</strong> create near infinite replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong>: <strong>accessible auto-combat</strong> keeps the pace high while <strong>deep skill builds and tactical choices</strong> reward mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant escalation</strong>: Levels grow more dangerous — every victory feels earned.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather your squad</strong>, <strong>tune your builds</strong>, and <strong>sprint through the dead</strong> to reach the dawn. <strong>Zombitality</strong> is about <strong>fast decisions, bigger risks and sweeter triumphs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you <strong>stay alive until sunrise</strong>?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive. Adapt. Overcome.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698150/extras/68be6c1b69e64b8be804dc5f1069ae69.poster.avif?t=1768462066\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698150/extras/68be6c1b69e64b8be804dc5f1069ae69.webm?t=1768462066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sh